# Keep the repository LF-only, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# Git's autocrlf rewrites these files to CRLF on checkout, which has already
# cost this project once: tooling that edits by matching multi-line anchors
# silently stops matching, and every file shows as wholly changed in a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets Git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
